# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command trace
usage 1   trace <count>                 arm a live CPU instruction trace for the next <count> instructions
usage 2   trace off                     cancel an in-progress trace early

case with no trace switch
target fake
covers 1-2
$ trace
out 32
Usage: trace <count> | trace off
status 0
action none
$ trace 10
out 50
No CPU trace switch is registered for this target.
status 0
action none
$ trace off
out 50
No CPU trace switch is registered for this target.
status 0
action none
end

case on venusrt
target venusrt
covers 1-2
$ trace 10
out 50
No CPU trace switch is registered for this target.
status 0
action none
$ trace off
out 50
No CPU trace switch is registered for this target.
status 0
action none
$ trace zz
out 50
No CPU trace switch is registered for this target.
status 0
action none
end

