case the count is hexadecimal
target venusrt
covers 1
$ trace 10
out 50
No CPU trace switch is registered for this target.
status 0
action none
$ trace 0x10
out 50
No CPU trace switch is registered for this target.
status 0
action none
$ trace 0
out 50
No CPU trace switch is registered for this target.
status 0
action none
$ trace -1
out 50
No CPU trace switch is registered for this target.
status 0
action none
end
